# note: The extended format: a VP8X chunk ahead of the frame.
# expect: ok
# roundtrip: no
# exercises: ParseVP8X(). The canvas size is written as width and height less
#   one, and here it agrees with the frame behind it. No file in the corpus had
#   a VP8X chunk at all before this one.
chunks VP8X VP8
width 32
height 32
yac_qi 30
macroblock
coeffs y2 -20
coeffs y[6] 1:4 -2
macroblock
intra_y_mode V_PRED
coeffs y2 12
macroblock count 2
